---
// The resume landing moved to /profile when the raw resume became the
// executive profile (2026-08-24). SSR stub, not a config redirect, for the
// same reason as about.astro: a config redirect to a prerendered page gets
// resolved internally by the Cloudflare adapter and served as a 200 copy.
export const prerender = false;
return Astro.redirect('/profile', 301);
